{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Do not come near here.</b> The meaning: stand in your place, and do not approach the bush, where the fire is. Similarly, \"Come near here, any man\" (1 Samuel 10:22). The word של is missing nun, like גע (Psalms 144:5), for it is from the root of ונשל גוים רבים (Deuteronomy 7:1)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:40.317213493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}